### 1. Maqsad yaratish/yangilash (goalKey bo'yicha upsert)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/conversions/goals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "goalKey": "payment",
  "name": "Qarz to'landi",
  "attributionWindowHours": 72,
  "attributionModel": "LAST_CALL",
  "enabled": true
}

### 2. Kompaniyaning maqsadlari
GET http://localhost:8080/api/conversions/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Konversiya haqida xabar berish (odatda CRM, X-Api-Key bilan)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "goalKey": "payment",
  "phone": "998901234567",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-07T12:00:00Z",
  "valueUzs": 1500000,
  "source": "crm",
  "dedupeKey": "payment-88231",
  "evidence": { "orderId": "88231", "method": "PAYME" }
}

### 4. O'sha dedupeKey bilan qayta yuborish — hech narsa o'zgarmaydi, duplicate: true
POST http://localhost:8080/api/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "goalKey": "payment",
  "phone": "998901234567",
  "occurredAt": "2026-09-07T12:00:00Z",
  "valueUzs": 1500000,
  "source": "crm",
  "dedupeKey": "payment-88231"
}

### 5. A/B hisoboti — endi haqiqiy konversiya va xarajat ustunlari bilan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns/1/variants/report
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 6. Maqsadni o'chirish (aslida o'chiriladi emas, faqat o'chiriladi = disabled)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/conversions/goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
